{"13-2051.00":{"code":"13-2051.00","title":"Financial and Investment Analysts","description":"Conduct quantitative analyses of information involving investment programs or financial data of public or private institutions, including valuation of businesses.","tasks":[{"text":"Advise clients on aspects of capitalization, such as amounts, sources, or timing.","type":"n/a"},{"text":"Analyze financial or operational performance of companies facing financial difficulties to identify or recommend remedies.","type":"n/a"},{"text":"Assess companies as investments for clients by examining company facilities.","type":"n/a"},{"text":"Collaborate on projects with other professionals, such as lawyers, accountants, or public relations experts.","type":"n/a"},{"text":"Collaborate with investment bankers to attract new corporate clients.","type":"n/a"},{"text":"Conduct financial analyses related to investments in green construction or green retrofitting projects.","type":"n/a"},{"text":"Confer with clients to restructure debt, refinance debt, or raise new debt.","type":"n/a"},{"text":"Create client presentations of plan details.","type":"n/a"},{"text":"Determine the prices at which securities should be syndicated and offered to the public.","type":"n/a"},{"text":"Develop and maintain client relationships.","type":"n/a"},{"text":"Draw charts and graphs, using computer spreadsheets, to illustrate technical reports.","type":"n/a"},{"text":"Employ financial models to develop solutions to financial problems or to assess the financial or capital impact of transactions.","type":"n/a"},{"text":"Evaluate and compare the relative quality of various securities in a given industry.","type":"n/a"},{"text":"Evaluate capital needs of clients and assess market conditions to inform structuring of financial packages.","type":"n/a"},{"text":"Inform investment decisions by analyzing financial information to forecast business, industry, or economic conditions.","type":"n/a"},{"text":"Interpret data on p